From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Gofman <pgofman@codeweavers.com>
Date: Mon, 15 Mar 2021 21:59:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] kernel32: Implement GetPackagesByPackageFamily().

For Forza Horizon 4.

(cherry picked from commit 7b4037421ea8c407837548f0f9a1b5ca5e2b1226)
mproton-resolved: 11.20 already has PackageFullNameFromId() (with its own tests) and only a stub GetPackagesByPackageFamily(); replaced the stub with Proton's registry-based implementation and kept both test functions.
